---
// The napkin maths from GitHub's code-search post (Clem, 2023): scanning everything with
// ripgrep vs asking an n-gram index. Each tiny square is one CPU core; the left grid has
// 64 x 32 = 2,048 of them. Numbers are the post's: 0.6 GB/s per core, 115 TB, 15.5 billion
// documents, 2,048 cores for 96 s = 0.01 queries/s; index: about 100 ms of one core per shard
// (p99), a 64-core host serves roughly 640 queries/s. Plain inline SVG, no ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 404;
const gx = 24;
const gy = 124;
const step = 5.5;
const colsN = 64;
const rowsN = 32;
const dash = `4 ${step - 4}`;
const rowLines = Array.from({ length: rowsN }, (_, r) => gy + r * step + 2);
const rx = 560;
---
<figure class="gm">
  <div class="gm-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Scanning 115 TB of code with grep would keep 2,048 CPU cores busy for 96 seconds per query, about 0.01 queries per second. An n-gram index answers a query with about 100 milliseconds of one core, so a 64-core host serves roughly 640 queries per second.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="gm-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One query: scan everything, or ask the index</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một truy vấn: quét hết, hay hỏi index</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="46" class="gm-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Each small square is one CPU core. Napkin maths from GitHub's own post.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi ô vuông nhỏ là một nhân CPU. Tính nhẩm theo bài của chính GitHub.</tspan>
    </text>

    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={34} y={78} size={28} />
    <text x="62" y="74" class="gm-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Scan all code with ripgrep</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Quét toàn bộ code bằng ripgrep</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="62" y="92" class="gm-t2">
      <tspan data-lang-en>115 TB, 15.5 billion documents, 0.6 GB/s per core</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>115 TB, 15,5 tỉ tài liệu, 0,6 GB/s mỗi nhân</tspan>
    </text>
    {rowLines.map((y) => (
      <line x1={gx} x2={gx + colsN * step - (step - 4)} y1={y} y2={y} class="gm-core" stroke-dasharray={dash} />
    ))}
    <text x={gx} y={gy + rowsN * step + 24} class="gm-v is-hot">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2,048 cores busy for 96 seconds</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2.048 nhân bận trong 96 giây</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={gx} y={gy + rowsN * step + 44} class="gm-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One query. That is 0.01 queries per second.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cho một truy vấn. Tức là 0,01 truy vấn mỗi giây.</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="470" x2="470" y1="62" y2="352" class="gm-div" />

    <DiagramIcon name="index" x={rx + 14} y={78} size={28} />
    <text x={rx + 42} y="74" class="gm-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Ask the n-gram index</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hỏi index n-gram</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={rx + 42} y="92" class="gm-t2">
      <tspan data-lang-en>25 TB index, split across shards</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Index 25 TB, chia ra nhiều shard</tspan>
    </text>
    <circle cx={rx + 40} cy={gy + 22} r="16" class="gm-ring" />
    <rect x={rx + 38} y={gy + 20} width="4" height="4" class="gm-core-one" />
    <text x={rx + 72} y={gy + 18} class="gm-v is-hit">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1 core, about 100 ms</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1 nhân, khoảng 100 ms</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={rx + 72} y={gy + 38} class="gm-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>on a shard (p99)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>trên một shard (p99)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={rx} y={gy + 100} class="gm-v is-hit">
      <tspan data-lang-en>A 64-core host: roughly</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một máy 64 nhân: khoảng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={rx} y={gy + 130} class="gm-big">
      <tspan data-lang-en>640 queries per second</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>640 truy vấn mỗi giây</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={rx} y={gy + 154} class="gm-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>against 0.01 for grep.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>so với 0,01 của grep.</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="366" y2="366" class="gm-rule" />
    <text x="20" y="390" class="gm-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The single square is drawn at the same size as the 2,048 on the left, with a ring so you can find it.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ô đơn lẻ vẽ cùng cỡ với 2.048 ô bên trái, có thêm vòng tròn để dễ thấy.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The scan needs a whole fleet for one answer. The index reads a small slice, so it can answer many queries at once.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Quét thì cần cả một đội máy cho một câu trả lời. Index chỉ đọc một lát nhỏ, nên trả lời được nhiều truy vấn cùng lúc.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gm { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gm-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gm svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gm text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gm .gm-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gm .gm-sub { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gm .gm-t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gm .gm-t2 { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gm .gm-v { font-weight: 700; }
  .gm .gm-v.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .gm .gm-v.is-hit { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gm .gm-big { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gm .gm-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gm-core { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 4; fill: none; opacity: 0.8; }
  .gm-core-one { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gm-ring { fill: none; stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .gm-div { stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 6 5; }
  .gm-rule { stroke: var(--border); }
  .gm figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
